  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8231766",
      "title": "Moving Logic To Components That Actually Need It (\"Moving State Down\")",
      "sourceHash": "3454b93e62f361d801308844631c1afc0ac30d9d7f975c32a017416692db0c89",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 2.04,
          "en": "So now that we added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "this new Question component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 7.98,
          "en": "we fixed this problem with our key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "but we also kind of added a new problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 14.55,
          "en": "because now we have to pass a lot of props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.55,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "that are managed in the Quiz component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 20.01,
          "en": "to the Question component just to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.01,
          "end": 21.573,
          "en": "that it works correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 25.53,
          "en": "And this is something we can improve here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.53,
          "end": 29.79,
          "en": "and at the same time, we'll improve this Quiz component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.79,
          "end": 32.31,
          "en": "because, for example, all that logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 35.28,
          "en": "where we manage the answerState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.28,
          "end": 40.23,
          "en": "why does this need to happen here in the Quiz component?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.23,
          "end": 42.18,
          "en": "Well the answer is, it doesn't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.18,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "That is a great example for a state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 47.883,
          "en": "that does not need to be lifted up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.78,
          "end": 51.57,
          "en": "Because we can simply go to the Question component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.57,
          "end": 55.74,
          "en": "and then there, add a new state with the useState hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.74,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "that must be imported, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 61.293,
          "en": "that will belong only to this Question component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 66.78,
          "en": "And this could be a state where we wanna store an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.78,
          "end": 69.53999999999999,
          "en": "where we have the selectedAnswer, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 71.88,
          "en": "which initially is an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.88,
          "end": 75.393,
          "en": "and then let's say, isCorrect property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "which initially is null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 80.673,
          "en": "but which could then be true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 85.74,
          "en": "This is some state we could manage here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.74,
          "end": 89.01,
          "en": "and I'll name it answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.01,
          "end": 91.953,
          "en": "and have my setAnswer state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.62,
          "en": "And the idea now simply is to have a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.62,
          "end": 102.39,
          "en": "handleSelectAnswer, that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.39,
          "end": 104.91,
          "en": "whenever an answer is selected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.91,
          "end": 108.333,
          "en": "So therefore I'll point at handleSelectAnswer down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 113.78999999999999,
          "en": "and I then expect to get my answer text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.78999999999999,
          "end": 117.50999999999999,
          "en": "We can then call setAnswer and set this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.50999999999999,
          "end": 120.828,
          "en": "to a new object where selectedAnswer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.828,
          "end": 124.14,
          "en": "is equal to the answer we received here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.14,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "and isCorrect now must be derived.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "But it should only be derived after this one second",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 134.343,
          "en": "which we actually spend here in the Quiz component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.63,
          "end": 138.3,
          "en": "So for the moment, I'll still set it to null here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.3,
          "end": 140.97,
          "en": "which basically should say that we don't know yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.97,
          "end": 142.833,
          "en": "whether it's correct or wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.7,
          "end": 147.57999999999998,
          "en": "So therefore here, I then wanna set a timer with setTimeout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.44,
          "end": 153.44,
          "en": "where after one second we do set isCorrect to true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.25,
          "end": 158.37,
          "en": "So where I call setAnswer again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.37,
          "end": 162.57,
          "en": "and where I now set isCorrect equal to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162.57,
          "end": 164.4,
          "en": "and then I wanna set this to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 168.24,
          "en": "if this is the right answer or false if it's not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.24,
          "end": 170.88,
          "en": "But for that, we, of course, need to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 172.773,
          "en": "what the right answer is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.03,
          "end": 176.4,
          "en": "Now the great thing about this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.4,
          "end": 179.7,
          "en": "is that we have all questions and answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.7,
          "end": 182.43,
          "en": "in this questions.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.43,
          "end": 186.84,
          "en": "So we can simply import this file into Question.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.84,
          "end": 189.06,
          "en": "to take a look at the current question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.06,
          "end": 190.743,
          "en": "and get the right answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.79,
          "end": 196.65,
          "en": "So here in this file we can also import QUESTIONS from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.65,
          "end": 200.343,
          "en": "and then going up one level, questions.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 206.343,
          "en": "So that now, we can take a look at those questions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.29,
          "end": 212.25,
          "en": "And the great thing is that we also, of course, can find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.25,
          "end": 216.39,
          "en": "what the index of the currently active question is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.39,
          "end": 219.84,
          "en": "because in the Quiz component, we're setting this index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219.84,
          "end": 224.34,
          "en": "as a value on key on this Question component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.34,
          "end": 226.95,
          "en": "And we can, of course, try using that key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.95,
          "end": 230.37,
          "en": "on our own component for our own purposes as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.37,
          "end": 234.75,
          "en": "So in our Question component, we can therefore destructure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.75,
          "end": 238.2,
          "en": "this key prop and also use it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 238.2,
          "end": 240.09,
          "en": "So now with that here in this Timeout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 240.09,
          "end": 244.08,
          "en": "we can access QUESTIONS for the key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 244.08,
          "end": 247.5,
          "en": "so for this activeQuestionIndex to take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.5,
          "end": 250.26,
          "en": "at a specific question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.26,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "And then we take a look at the first answer there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.96,
          "end": 255.24,
          "en": "which we know is the correct answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 255.24,
          "end": 258.06,
          "en": "for the selected question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.06,
          "end": 261.06,
          "en": "And we compare that to our answer here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 261.06,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "And if that here yields true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 265.62,
          "en": "we know that the correct answer was picked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 265.62,
          "end": 267.723,
          "en": "otherwise it's the wrong answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 269.76,
          "end": 272.88,
          "en": "And with that, we can now use our own answerState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.88,
          "end": 274.68,
          "en": "to update the UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 274.68,
          "end": 276.96,
          "en": "So the value for answerState here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 276.96,
          "end": 279.123,
          "en": "should now be correct or wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.02,
          "end": 283.29,
          "en": "So we can add a little helper variable here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.29,
          "end": 286.05,
          "en": "which I'll name answerState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.05,
          "end": 290.133,
          "en": "which initially is simply an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.42,
          "end": 296.42,
          "en": "just as my old answerState here was in the Quiz component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 299.55,
          "end": 304.55,
          "en": "But if in our answerState here in the Question component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 304.95,
          "end": 308.79,
          "en": "if there we got a selectedAnswer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 308.79,
          "end": 313.48,
          "en": "I wanna set answerState depending on answer.isCorrect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.67,
          "end": 317.79,
          "en": "And if that's true, I wanna set it to correct,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 317.79,
          "end": 319.713,
          "en": "otherwise I'll set it to wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 320.88,
          "end": 322.98,
          "en": "And then it's this answerState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 322.98,
          "end": 325.08299999999997,
          "en": "that will be passed to answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 327,
          "end": 330.36,
          "en": "Now of course, that's now clashing with my answerState prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 330.36,
          "end": 333.36,
          "en": "but this prop can and should now be removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 333.36,
          "end": 335.013,
          "en": "because we don't need it anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 337.38,
          "end": 340.65,
          "en": "Now onSelectAnswer will not be removed though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 340.65,
          "end": 344.76,
          "en": "because we will still need to pass the selectedAnswer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 344.76,
          "end": 346.71,
          "en": "to the Quiz component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 346.71,
          "end": 348.99,
          "en": "because, of course, in the Quiz component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.99,
          "end": 352.71,
          "en": "we still wanna store all the selected userAnswers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 352.71,
          "end": 356.64300000000003,
          "en": "so that we can also find out when the quiz is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 358.35,
          "end": 360.97,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll call onSelectAnswer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 362.79,
          "end": 366.99,
          "en": "here once this Timeout expired and once we show the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 366.99,
          "end": 369.813,
          "en": "whether the picked answer is correct or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 370.89,
          "end": 374.76,
          "en": "To be precise, here, I then wanna set another timer again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 374.76,
          "end": 377.463,
          "en": "so that we don't instantly move away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 378.66,
          "end": 382.06,
          "en": "where after two seconds, we call onSelectAnswer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 382.98,
          "end": 386.94,
          "en": "and pass the selectedAnswer to this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 386.94,
          "end": 390.06,
          "en": "and that will then trigger the connected function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 390.06,
          "end": 391.683,
          "en": "in the Quiz component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 392.76,
          "end": 395.76,
          "en": "Now with that, we can still get rid of some props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 395.76,
          "end": 398.58,
          "en": "here in this Question component though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 398.58,
          "end": 402.24,
          "en": "For example, answers and questionText,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 402.24,
          "end": 405.54,
          "en": "because we are importing the raw data now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 405.54,
          "end": 409.01,
          "en": "and we know that the key is the activeQuestionIndex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 410.22,
          "end": 414.21,
          "en": "Therefore, we can get rid of those props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 414.21,
          "end": 419.21,
          "en": "and instead, here, simply use questions for the key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 419.25,
          "end": 421.95,
          "en": "and then text, because the key, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 421.95,
          "end": 424.77,
          "en": "is the activeQuestionIndex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 424.77,
          "end": 428.403,
          "en": "And for the answer, it's QUESTIONS[key].answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 431.43,
          "end": 436.113,
          "en": "So with that, we got two props less that we have to accept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 437.82,
          "end": 441.21,
          "en": "The selectedAnswer is also not needed anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 441.21,
          "end": 443.79,
          "en": "because we're now storing this here in our state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 443.79,
          "end": 445.983,
          "en": "that belongs to this Question component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 447.48,
          "end": 450.54,
          "en": "We now just have to update the selectedAnswer down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 450.54,
          "end": 453.783,
          "en": "and set this equal to answer.selectedAnswer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 454.74,
          "end": 457.92,
          "en": "which is that selectedAnswer we are now managing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 457.92,
          "end": 460.443,
          "en": "in our own state here in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 462.3,
          "end": 464.94,
          "en": "And with that, this question component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 464.94,
          "end": 469.77,
          "en": "now contains more logic and needs less props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 469.77,
          "end": 472.2,
          "en": "Therefore, in the Quiz component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 472.2,
